# Root notes for local/Cloudflare development.
#
# Frontend never receives platform API keys.
# Platform secrets:
#   - Cloudflare: `.dev.vars` (see `.dev.vars.example`) or `wrangler secret put`
#   - Legacy Express/Docker: `server/.env` (see `server/.env.example`)
#
# User BYOK stays in the browser (Settings). Do not add VITE_* secret keys.
